<title>UK: DSL Finance sets 250 mln mark five-year bond.</title>
<headline>DSL Finance sets 250 mln mark five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers (joint books) SBC Warburg and Societe Generale.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DSL FINANCE NV</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  DSL BANK DEUTSCHE SIEDLUNGS-UND LANDESRENTENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    250 MLN DEM   COUPON     5.0	 MATURITY    07.MAY.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.95    PAY DATE    07.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 REOFFER    100.20    SPREAD	+24 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    FFT	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  GOV LAW     GERMAN</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   NO</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.75	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
